=== Auto: RAG Direct Answer ===
They experimented under three evaluation settings: **IN-DOMAIN**, **OUT-OF-DOMAIN**, and **CROSS-DATASET**, which allow them to evaluate models both on the quality of domain-aware text representation and on their adaptation ability in unfamiliar domains [1]. The IN-DOMAIN source domains are the first five domains of their MULTI-SUM dataset, while the OUT-OF-DOMAIN domains are totally invisible during training, testing how models perform on unseen domains [6].
